DESCRIPTION >
    One row per error (event `error`). `component`: policy | grounding | reflection (a failed VLM call),
    run (the run aborted, including Ctrl-C), telemetry (a Tinybird send that failed and was dropped;
    it lands with a later successful send). `retry_count` = retries attempted before giving up.

TOKEN "agent_telemetry_append" APPEND

SCHEMA >
    `timestamp` DateTime64(3) `json:$.timestamp`,
    `event_id` String `json:$.event_id`,
    `run_id` String `json:$.run_id`,
    `model` LowCardinality(String) `json:$.model`,
    `episode_id` Nullable(String) `json:$.episode_id`,
    `episode_index` Nullable(UInt32) `json:$.episode_index`,
    `step_index` Nullable(UInt16) `json:$.step_index`,
    `component` LowCardinality(String) `json:$.component`,
    `error_type` String `json:$.error_type`,
    `message` String `json:$.message`,
    `retry_count` UInt8 `json:$.retry_count`

ENGINE MergeTree
ENGINE_PARTITION_KEY toYYYYMM(timestamp)
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY component, run_id, timestamp
